    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Labĕātes</span></b> ,
			ĭum (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Labĕātae</span></b> ,
		ārum, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 22, 26, § 144</span></i>),
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people of Illyria, whose capital was</i> Scodra, <i><span class="en">Liv. 44,
			31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">45,
			26</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Labĕātis</span></b> ,
			īdis, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to the Labeates</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					44, 31, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Meteone Labeatidis terrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					44, 23, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
